// tests/data/field-presets/test/format-uint.slangp — Session 9 field
// regression (verbatim port of upstream corpus test/format.slangp at the
// pinned revision, e1d75632): an R32_UINT pack/unpack round-trip. Pass 0
// writes a packed uint into an R32_UINT FBO; pass 1 reads it back through
// usampler2D + texelFetch + unpackUnorm4x8. Before the Session 9 sampler
// rewrite fix, the usampler2D declaration kept its source-level set/binding,
// desyncing the SPIR-V from the chain's canonical layout (empty set 0) —
// llvmpipe segfaulted at draw, the AMD Windows driver returned
// VK_ERROR_UNKNOWN at pipeline creation (fork field log Session 8).
// Integer-FBO formats must render byte-stably; the golden compares the
// decoded 0.3-scaled testcard.
shaders = 2
shader0 = shaders/format_uint.slang
shader1 = shaders/decode_format_uint.slang
scale_type0 = source
scale0 = 1.0
filter_linear0 = false
filter_linear1 = false
